    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771020/extras/9ada6e934046c21ce1242516da253c13.avif?t=1750187090\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life in Rio</strong> is a choice-driven visual novel set in Rio de Janeiro, Brazil. You take on the role of Elza, an innocent young woman raised under the strict doctrines of her parents\u2019 church. From a young age, she was groomed to become the ideal woman\u2014expected to save her body for her future husband. But unforeseen events altered the course of her life, thrusting her into an impure, corrupted world. Now, she must navigate a reality where she\u2019s a lamb among wolves, each one eager to claim a piece of her. The choices you make will shape Elza\u2019s fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771020/extras/577f947808ad862ea1f3dce21b1ae866.avif?t=1750187090\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No one warns you when you\u2019ve crossed the line.<br>You only realize it once you\u2019re already on the other side.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elza was raised to be the perfect woman\u2014or at least what she was taught perfection meant.<br>From childhood, she lived by the pillars of obedience, purity, and silence.<br>She grew up in a deeply religious household, where the pastor\u2019s words outweighed her own thoughts,<br>and being \u201cgood\u201d meant saying \u201cyes,\u201d lowering her gaze, and never raising her voice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771020/extras/3caf8584dc6fb62b8a4d721fe564d761.avif?t=1750187090\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The walls here have eyes.<br>And I... have desires I never dared to speak aloud.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She tried to resist. But it wasn\u2019t always possible.<br>Sometimes the door was locked.<br>Sometimes the only way out seemed to be giving in.<br>And worse: in certain moments, her body reacted before her mind could.<br>A shiver, a hidden longing, a feeling that grew inside her like a pleasurable mistake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771020/extras/21ae3b1e534c459b8bc266a63bcd782f.avif?t=1750187090\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >My heart is racing.<br>With fear\u2026 or something else?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She never wanted to be corrupted.<br>But she also didn\u2019t know how to protect herself.<br>And by the time she realized it, she was already in too deep to come out unscathed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771020/extras/08cc0eed8865a66bc8b6bc90e933a920.avif?t=1750187090\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Part of me wants to run.<br>The other\u2026 wants to stay a little longer.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the worst sin wasn\u2019t what they did to her\u2014<br>It was what she started wanting to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771020/extras/4d85ea5a6d15eb8ba29cfc6b2e1dbacd.avif?t=1750187090\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If I could, I\u2019d hide you from the world.<br>Just so no one could ruin your purity.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On her journey, Elza will make friends.<br>Some will want to see her smile\u2026<br>Others will want to make her pay for every smile she gives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771020/extras/143259d2b34ac9b4fb0d71622aa50715.poster.avif?t=1750187090\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771020/extras/143259d2b34ac9b4fb0d71622aa50715.webm?t=1750187090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771020/extras/143259d2b34ac9b4fb0d71622aa50715.mp4?t=1750187090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771020/extras/9ada6e934046c21ce1242516da253c13.avif?t=1750187090\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Life in Rio</strong> is a choice-driven visual novel set in Rio de Janeiro, Brazil. You take on the role of Elza, an innocent young woman raised under the strict doctrines of her parents\u2019 church. From a young age, she was groomed to become the ideal woman\u2014expected to save her body for her future husband. But unforeseen events altered the course of her life, thrusting her into an impure, corrupted world. Now, she must navigate a reality where she\u2019s a lamb among wolves, each one eager to claim a piece of her. The choices you make will shape Elza\u2019s fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771020/extras/577f947808ad862ea1f3dce21b1ae866.avif?t=1750187090\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No one warns you when you\u2019ve crossed the line.<br>You only realize it once you\u2019re already on the other side.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elza was raised to be the perfect woman\u2014or at least what she was taught perfection meant.<br>From childhood, she lived by the pillars of obedience, purity, and silence.<br>She grew up in a deeply religious household, where the pastor\u2019s words outweighed her own thoughts,<br>and being \u201cgood\u201d meant saying \u201cyes,\u201d lowering her gaze, and never raising her voice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771020/extras/3caf8584dc6f