e world.<br>Just so no one could ruin your purity.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On her journey, Elza will make friends.<br>Some will want to see her smile\u2026<br>Others will want to make her pay for every smile she gives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771020/extras/143259d2b34ac9b4fb0d71622aa50715.poster.avif?t=1750187090\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771020/extras/143259d2b34ac9b4fb0d71622aa50715.webm?t=1750187090\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771020/extras/143259d2b34ac9b4fb0d71622aa50715.mp4?t=1750187090\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
